                                                "sense_id": "742bb51f-8f5a-3cf0-b82d-131ac46bc238",
                                                "text": "Her driver was new to the country; he mightn't be prepared for the leaping of the yellow water down dry arroyos, swift as the pouncings of a cat, or the snake-like slidings of tons of loosened rock and clay from the steep potreros […]"
